       one another is supported.  In such cases, multiple information  records
       can be returned for an event alongside the generic _f_a_n_o_t_i_f_y___e_v_e_n_t___m_e_t_a_‐
       _d_a_t_a  structure.   For  example, if a notification group is initialized
