       Each  information  record  has  a  nested  structure   of   type   _f_a_n_‐
       _o_t_i_f_y___e_v_e_n_t___i_n_f_o___h_e_a_d_e_r.   It  is imperative for event listeners to in‐
       spect the _i_n_f_o___t_y_p_e field of this structure in order to  determine  the
