              fies filesystem objects by file handles, the value of  _e_v_e_n_t___l_e_n
              is  always  FFAANN__EEVVEENNTT__MMEETTAADDAATTAA__LLEENN.  For a group that identifies
              filesystem objects by file handles, _e_v_e_n_t___l_e_n also includes  the
              variable size file identifier records.

       _v_e_r_s   This field holds a version number for the structure.  It must be
              compared  to FFAANNOOTTIIFFYY__MMEETTAADDAATTAA__VVEERRSSIIOONN to verify that the struc‐
              tures returned at run time match the structures defined at  com‐
